<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JON" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">Yoonasa maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yoonasa maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoona</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yoonasa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yoonasa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Yoonasa Maxaafay, hara nabe maxaafatape dumma maxaafa. Ha maxaafay, Yoonasi Xoossa kiita ixas gidaysanne guyepe kiitetida taarike odeesipe attishin, sinthara yaanaba odenna.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yoonasi Isra7eeles mata morke gidida Asoore waanna katama Nanawe kiita ekidi bana mela Xoossi kiittis. Shin Yoonasi he deriyas markatidi simmin, Xoossay he katama maaranaysa eriya gisho, baanaw koybeenna. Hanoshin, dumma duma hanotatape guye, wolqan yaa bis. Yoonasi kiitetidi simmin Nanawe asay banta nagara paaxidi Godaako simmidosona. Goday enta maaris.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha maxaafan, wursetha shempuwan Xoossay Yoonasa tamaarsanaw naagetonaba oothidi tamaarsidaysa bessees. Wursethan, Godaas ba medhetetha bolla gita maati de7eysa, I maariya Xoossi gideysanne hari attoshin, ba asaa morketaka maariya Xoossi gideysa qoncisees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe Qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Yoonasi Xoossafe baqatanaw dendis <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JON 1:1-7">1:1-7</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yoonasa woosa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JON 2:1-10">2:1-10</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nanawe asay Xoossako simuwa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JON 3:1-10">3:1-10</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossa maarotanne Yoonasa yiluwa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JON 4:1-11">4:1-11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JON 1" />
  <para style="s1">Yoonasi Xoossafe Baqatuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 1:1" />Godaa qaalay Amaate na7aa, Yoonasas haysada yaagidi qoncis. <verse eid="JON 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 1:2" />“He katama asa iitatethay ta sinthe gakida gisho, dendada hini wolqaama katama Nanawe bada sabbaka” yaagis. <verse eid="JON 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 1:3" />Shin Yoonasi Godaa sinthafe betidi Tarsesa biitta baanaw keyis. I, Yoophe katama wodhidi Tarsesa biya markabe demmis. Godaa sinthafe betanaw koyidi Tarsesa baanaw koshshiya miishe ciggidi markabiyan gelis. <verse eid="JON 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 1:4" />Shin Goday abba bolla wolqaama carkuwa denthis. Abban wolqaama hobbey wolqaamida gisho markabiya meqanaw gakasu. <verse eid="JON 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 1:5" />Yaatin markabiya oosanchoti yayyidosona. Issoy issoy ba xoossaako ba xoossaako waassis. Qassi markabey kawuyana mela giddon de7iya caana denthidi abban yeggidosona. Shin Yoonasi markabiyas giddo gelidi wolqaama dhisko dhiskis. <verse eid="JON 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 1:6" />Markabiya laaggeysi iyako shiiqidi, “Haysa mela saaten waana dhiskay? Denda ne xoossa woossa! Ooni eri I nuus qadhetidi nuna ashshanekonne” yaagis.<verse eid="JON 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoonasi Abban Yegetis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 1:7" />Markabiya oosanchoti issoy issuwako, “Haa yiite, ha iitabay nuna oodde gaason gakidaako eranaw saama yeggana” yaagidosona. Saama yeggin, saamay Yoonasa bolla wodhis. <verse eid="JON 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 1:8" />Enti Yoonasako, “Ha iitabay oodde gaason nu bolla gakidaako ane nuus oda. Ne oosoy aybee? Awupe yadii? Ne biittay awee? Neeni oodde baggee?” yaagidi oychidosona. <verse eid="JON 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 1:9" />Yoonasi zaaridi, “Taani Ibraawe asi; abbanne biitta medhida Godaa, salo Xoossa goyinniya asi” yaagis. <verse eid="JON 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 1:10" />I entaw koyrottidi odidaysada I Godaa sinthafe beteysa eridosona. Hessa gisho, enti yayyidi, “La ayba palaba oothadi” yaagidosona. <verse eid="JON 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 1:11" />Abbaa hobbey kaseysafe haa darida gisho asati Yoonasa, “Nuus abbay si77i gaana mela nena nuuni waatino?” yaagidi oychidosona. <verse eid="JON 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JON 1:12" />Ika, “Ha wolqaama hobbey hinte bolla dendiday ta gaason gideysa taani erayis. Hessa gisho, tana ekidi abban yeggite. Yaatiko abbay hintew si77i gaana” yaagis. <verse eid="JON 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JON 1:13" />Shin markabiya oosanchoti markabiya gaxa kessanaw gita pidhidosona. Shin abba hobbey haa darida gisho gaxa kessanaw danda7ibookona. <verse eid="JON 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JON 1:14" />Hessa gisho, enti Godaako, “Abeeti Godaw, haa ura shempuwa gisho, neeni nuna dhaysonadanne ha geeshsha suutha acuwa neeni nuupe achonada nuuni nena minthidi woossoos” yaagidi Godaa woossidosona. <verse eid="JON 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JON 1:15" />Hessafe guye, Yoonasa denthidi, abban yeggidosona. Abbaa hobbayka si77i gis. <verse eid="JON 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JON 1:16" />Yaatin asati Godaas daro yayyidi yarsho yarshidosona; iyaw qangidosona. <verse eid="JON 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JON 1:17" />Yoonasa mittana mela issi gita molo Goday giigisis. Yoonasi he moluwa ulon heedzu gallasinne heedzu qamma gam7is.<verse eid="JON 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JON 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yoonasa Woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 2:1" />Yoonasi moluwa ulon de7ishe, ba Godaa Xoossaa haysada yaagidi woossis.<verse eid="JON 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 2:2" />“Taani ta waayan de7ashe nena xeegas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:2">neka taw si7adasa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:2">Taani Si7oole ciimmuwa giddon de7ashe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:2">maado koyada neeko waassas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:2">Neka ta waasuwa si7adasa.<verse eid="JON 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 2:3" />Neeni tana abba ciimmuwan duge yeggadasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:3">Haathi ta yuushuwa teqis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:3">wolqaama zuley ta bollara aadhis.<verse eid="JON 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 2:4" />‘Taani ne sinthafe wora holetas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:4">Shin ne Geeshsha Keetha zaarada be7ana’ gada qopas.<verse eid="JON 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 2:5" />Haathi taw qoodhe gakis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:5">Abbaa ciimmoy tana mittis.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:5">Abban de7iya maatay ta huuphen xaaxetis.<verse eid="JON 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 2:6" />Taani haatha garsan de7iya dereta baasuwa gakada mitettas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:6">biitta wulay merinaw ta bolla gordetis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:6">Shin ta Godaw Xoossaw, neeni ta shempiw iita ollafe kessadasa.<verse eid="JON 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 2:7" />Ta shempiya doccida wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:7">Godaw ta nena qopas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:7">ta woosay neeko ne Geeshsha keethaa gakis.<verse eid="JON 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 2:8" />Hada gidida eeqa xoossata bolla zempeysati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:8">new de7iya banta ammanetetha aggoosona.<verse eid="JON 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 2:9" />Shin taani galata mazmure new yarshana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:9">Ta qangidabaaka new gathana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:9">Ayis giiko, atotethay Xoossafe” yaagis.<verse eid="JON 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 2:10" />Hessafe guye, Goday moluwa kiittis. Moloy Yoonasa mela biitta bolla cooyis.<verse eid="JON 2:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JON 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yoonasi Nanawe Buussaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 3:1" />Godaa qaalay nam7antho Yoonasako haysada yaagidi yis. <verse eid="JON 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 3:2" />“Dendada gita katamaa Nanawe ba; ta new odiya qaala entaw awaaja” yaagis.<verse eid="JON 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 3:3" />Yoonasi Godaas kiitetidi Nanawe bis. Nanawey daro gita katama. Ha gaxape hini gaxa gakanaw heedzu qamma hemethees. <verse eid="JON 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 3:4" />Yoonasi katama gelidi issi gallasa oge hemetidi, “Nanawey oytamu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraawetho doonan xaafetidaysan oytamu giya wode hara kase birshethati heedza goosona.</char></note> gallasape guye dhayana” yaagidi awaajis.<verse eid="JON 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 3:5" />Nanawe asay Xoossaa ammanidosona. Xooma awaajidosona; guuthafe gita gakanaw asi ubbay kayo ma7o ma7idosona.<verse eid="JON 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nanawe Asay Godaako Simuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 3:6" />Nanawe kawoy he oda si7ida wode ba kawotetha araatape wodhidi, kawotetha ma7uwa qaaridi kayo ma7o ma7idi bido bolla uttis. <verse eid="JON 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 3:7" />Nanawe deriyas haysada yaagidi awaajisis: “kawapenne iya moorinatape keyida kiittada hachife doomidi hinteranne hinte mehetara, aybibaaka moonna mela uyonna mela. <verse eid="JON 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 3:8" />Asinne mehe ubbay kayo ma7o ma77o. Issi issi asi minthidi Xoossaako waasso. Ba iita ogiyape simmo, ba iita oosuwaka aggo. <verse eid="JON 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 3:9" />Xoossay nuus qadhetidi, nuuni dhayona mela ba wolqaama hanquwafe simmaneko ooni eri!” yaagis.<verse eid="JON 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 3:10" />Enti banta iita ogiyape simmidaysa Xoossay be7ida wode entaw qadhetidi enta bolla ehana gida iitaba aggaagis.<verse eid="JON 3:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JON 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yoonasa Yilonne Godaa Maarota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 4:1" />Shin hessi Yoonasa daro ufaysibeenna. Hessa gisho, I yilotis. <verse eid="JON 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 4:2" />Godaako, “Abeeti Godaw taani koyro ta biittan de7ashe gidaysi haysa gidennee? Taani ne sinthafe betada Tarsesa baanaw ellesiday haysasa. Neeni qadheynne maaroti kumida Xoossi gideysa, hanqos ellesonaysanne wuronna siiqon kumidaysa, qassi ehana gida iitabaka qadhetada aggiya Xoossi gideysa taani kaseka erayis. <verse eid="JON 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 4:3" />Ha7i Abeeti Godaw, hayyana tana wodha; de7ope taw hayqoy lo77o” yaagidi woossis.<verse eid="JON 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 4:4" />Goday iyako, “Neeni haysatho shenetanaw bessii?” yaagis.<verse eid="JON 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 4:5" />Hessafe guye, Yoonasi katamaape gaxa keyidi doloha baggan uttis. Hessan baw shaqara shaqaridi I kuyan uttidi katama bolla gakanaw de7iyaba ba7anaw naagees. <verse eid="JON 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 4:6" />Awa suulape Yoonasa ashshana mela Goday issi gose dolisis. He gose haythay Yoonasa huuphe bolla baggara kuya gidana mela oothis. Yoonasi he gose gaason daro ufaytis. <verse eid="JON 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 4:7" />Shin wontetha gallas wonta guura Xoossay guxune giigisis. He guxuniya gosey melana gakanaw masu. <verse eid="JON 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 4:8" />Away keyiya wode Xoossay doloha baggafe misha carko yeddis. Yoonasi labbanana gakanaw away Yoonasa huuphiya xuuggis. Yaatin I, “De7ope taw hayqoy lo77o” yaagidi hayqos woossis.<verse eid="JON 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 4:9" />Xoossay Yoonasako, “Neeni ha gose gisho yilotanaw bessii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JON 4:9">Yoonasi, “Ee bessees; ubbaraka hayqana gakanaw yilotanaw taw bessees” yaagis.<verse eid="JON 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 4:10" />Yaatin Xoossay Yoonasako, “Zine dolada hachi melida gosees, ne daaburonaaris, ne dichonaris haysa mela qadhetadasa. <verse eid="JON 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 4:11" />Shin ushachinne haddirsi shaakidi eronna xeetanne laatamu mukulu asinne daro mehey de7iya ha gita katamaa Nanawes taani qadhetanaw bessennee?” yaagis.<verse eid="JON 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 4" />
</usx>